-- Fixed positions of the NPCs, by name. Each name has a list of
-- { zone id, x, y, height }, because some names are used in more than one
-- zone. x and y are the two coordinates on the ground; the height is not
-- used for the distance.
--
-- Built from LandSandBoat (https://github.com/LandSandBoat/server, GPLv3),
-- data/zones/<zone>/npcs.yaml at commit e13548e, keeping only the names in
-- data/npcs.lua. NPCs without a position there are left out. A few NPCs
-- walk around, so the distance is approximate.
--
-- Added later from the same source (commit 1587420), for the Fame window:
-- Flaco, Mendi, Namonutice, Ney Hiparujah, Vaultimand, Waylea and
-- Zabirego-Hajigo (the Fame Checkers).
--
-- And the four Windurst Gate Guards (they start the Windurst missions):
-- Mokyokyo, Janshura-Rashura, Rakoh Buuma and Zokima-Rokima. The ones that
-- move (Rakoh Buuma) are only approximate. Also the four Bastok mission
-- givers: Argus, Cleades, Malduc and Rashid; and the three San d'Oria ones:
-- Ambrotien, Endracion and Grilau.
--
-- Nanaa Mihgo only keeps her real position (Windurst Woods, where every
-- quest of hers starts: !pos 62 -4 240 in the server scripts). The other
-- entries of the source are cutscene-only actors in other zones.
--
-- Matching ignores case and apostrophes.

-- Local patch: positions of cutscene-only actors are left out (LSB status
-- cutscene_only, or no status with the hidden flags 27, e.g. Hooknox in
-- the Altar Room). Those NPCs cannot be seen or talked to there, so the
-- compass and the marker in the world pointed into walls. Valeriano kept.
--

